[0.418, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "========================================================================\r\nSTEP 0 — boot\r\n========================================================================\r\nRequirement under test: CYPRESS-RWA-TRANSACTIONS-007\r\nSeeded defect to demonstrate: payment-amount-cents — Payment amount is stored without the dollars-to-cents (x100) conversion, so transaction.amount ends up 100x too small.\r\n"]
[5.458, "o", "\r\n========================================================================\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "STEP 1 — the requirement, as authored (no curation, no AI involved here)\r\n========================================================================\r\n"]
[0.019, "o", "id:          CYPRESS-RWA-TRANSACTIONS-007\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "userStory:   As a user of cypress-rwa, I want \"creates a new payment\" so that the Transactions feature behaves as specified.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "acceptanceCriteria:\r\n  - Given the database has been seeded (cy.task(\"db:seed\"), backed by data/database-seed.json)\r\n  - Given the requesting client is authenticated as a seeded user via session-cookie login (cy.loginByApi)\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  - When a POST /transactions request is made\r\n  - When creates a new payment\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  - Then the response status is 200\r\n  - Then the response satisfies: `expect(response.body.transaction.id).to.be.a(\"string\");`\r\n  - Then the response satisfies: `expect(response.body.transaction.status).to.eq(\"complete\");`\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  - Then the response satisfies: `expect(response.body.transaction.requestStatus).to.eq(undefined);`\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "traceability: undefined\r\n\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "========================================================================\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "STEP 2 — GENERATE (agent) — the LLM writes an executable TestCase from the criteria above\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "========================================================================\r\n"]
[11.665, "o", "[llm] model=anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.5 prompt_tokens=1680 completion_tokens=1110\r\n"]
[10.553, "o", "[llm] model=anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.5 prompt_tokens=1875 completion_tokens=1115\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "Generated 2 test case(s):\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "{\r\n  \"id\": \"CYPRESS-RWA-TRANSACTIONS-007-positive-001\",\r\n  \"requirementId\": \"CYPRESS-RWA-TRANSACTIONS-007\",\r\n  \"title\": \"creates a new payment with authenticated user\",\r\n  \"kind\": \"positive\",\r\n  \"actor\": \"primaryUser\",\r\n  \"requests\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"Get test users for sender and receiver\",\r\n      \"method\": \"GET\",\r\n      \"pathTemplate\": \"/testData/users\",\r\n      \"expect\": {\r\n        \"status\": 200,\r\n        \"jsonPath\": [\r\n          {\r\n            \"path\": \"results[0].id\",\r\n            \"op\": \"exists\"\r\n          },\r\n          {\r\n            \"path\": \"results[1].id\",\r\n            \"op\": \"exists\"\r\n          },\r\n          {\r\n            \"path\": \"results[0].balance\",\r\n            \"op\": \"exists\"\r\n          },\r\n          {\r\n            \"path\": \"results[1].balance\",\r\n            \"op\": \"exists\"\r\n          }\r\n        ]\r\n      },\r\n      \"capture\": {\r\n        \"senderId\": \"results[0].id\",\r\n        \"receiverId\": \"results[1].id\",\r\n        \"senderBalanceBefore\": \"results[0].balance\",\r\n        \"receiverBalanceBefore\": \"res"]
[0.000, "o", "ults[1].balance\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"Get sender's bank accounts\",\r\n      \"method\": \"GET\",\r\n      \"pathTemplate\": \"/bankAccounts\",\r\n      \"expect\": {\r\n        \"status\": 200,\r\n        \"jsonPath\": [\r\n          {\r\n            \"path\": \"results[0].id\",\r\n            \"op\": \"exists\"\r\n          }\r\n        ]\r\n      },\r\n      \"capture\": {\r\n        \"bankAccountId\": \"results[0].id\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"Create payment transaction\",\r\n      \"method\": \"POST\",\r\n      \"pathTemplate\": \"/transactions\",\r\n      \"body\": {\r\n        \"transactionType\": \"payment\",\r\n        \"source\": \"{{bankAccountId}}\",\r\n        \"receiverId\": \"{{receiverId}}\",\r\n        \"description\": \"Payment for services\",\r\n        \"amount\": 50,\r\n        \"privacyLevel\": \"public\"\r\n      },\r\n      \"expect\": {\r\n        \"status\": 200,\r\n        \"jsonPath\": [\r\n          {\r\n            \"path\": \"transaction.id\",\r\n            \"op\": \"isType\",\r\n            \"value\": \"string\"\r\n          },\r\n          {\r\n            \"path\": \"transaction.status\","]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n            \"op\": \"eq\",\r\n            \"value\": \"complete\"\r\n          },\r\n          {\r\n            \"path\": \"transaction.requestStatus\",\r\n            \"op\": \"eq\",\r\n            \"value\": null\r\n          },\r\n          {\r\n            \"path\": \"transaction.amount\",\r\n            \"op\": \"eq\",\r\n            \"value\": 5000\r\n          }\r\n        ]\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"Verify balances after payment\",\r\n      \"method\": \"GET\",\r\n      \"pathTemplate\": \"/testData/users\",\r\n      \"expect\": {\r\n        \"status\": 200,\r\n        \"jsonPath\": [\r\n          {\r\n            \"path\": \"results[0].balance\",\r\n            \"op\": \"eq\",\r\n            \"value\": \"{{senderBalanceBefore - 5000}}\"\r\n          },\r\n          {\r\n            \"path\": \"results[1].balance\",\r\n            \"op\": \"eq\",\r\n            \"value\": \"{{receiverBalanceBefore + 5000}}\"\r\n          }\r\n        ]\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "{\r\n  \"id\": \"CYPRESS-RWA-TRANSACTIONS-007-auth-001\",\r\n  \"requirementId\": \"CYPRESS-RWA-TRANSACTIONS-007\",\r\n  \"title\": \"rejects unauthenticated payment creation\",\r\n  \"kind\": \"auth\",\r\n  \"actor\": \"anonymous\",\r\n  \"requests\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"Get test users for receiver\",\r\n      \"method\": \"GET\",\r\n      \"pathTemplate\": \"/testData/users\",\r\n      \"expect\": {\r\n        \"status\": 200,\r\n        \"jsonPath\": [\r\n          {\r\n            \"path\": \"results[1].id\",\r\n            \"op\": \"exists\"\r\n          }\r\n        ]\r\n      },\r\n      \"capture\": {\r\n        \"receiverId\": \"results[1].id\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"Attempt to create payment without authentication\",\r\n      \"method\": \"POST\",\r\n      \"pathTemplate\": \"/transactions\",\r\n      \"body\": {\r\n        \"transactionType\": \"payment\",\r\n        \"source\": \"fake-bank-account-id\",\r\n        \"receiverId\": \"{{receiverId}}\",\r\n        \"description\": \"Unauthorized payment attempt\",\r\n        \"amount\": 50,\r\n        \"privacyLevel\": \"public\"\r\n      },\r\n      \"expect\": {\r\n       "]
[0.000, "o", " \"status\": 401\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "========================================================================\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "STEP 3 — RUN (deterministic) — execute it 3x against the clean app, reset() before each run\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "========================================================================\r\n"]
[0.373, "o", "CYPRESS-RWA-TRANSACTIONS-007-positive-001: runs=[pass, pass, pass] -> PASS\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "========================================================================\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "STEP 4 — seed the real defect \"payment-amount-cents\" into the running container's source\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "========================================================================\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "file: /app/backend/database.ts\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "- amount: transactionDetails.amount * 100,\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "+ amount: transactionDetails.amount,\r\n"]
[3.800, "o", "\r\n========================================================================\r\nSTEP 5 — RUN again — SAME persisted TestCase, no regeneration, against the now-defective app\r\n========================================================================\r\n"]
[0.281, "o", "CYPRESS-RWA-TRANSACTIONS-007-positive-001: runs=[fail, fail, fail] -> FAIL\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "========================================================================\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "STEP 6 — TRIAGE (agent) — classify the failure; never told a defect was injected\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "========================================================================\r\n"]
[8.718, "o", "[llm] model=anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.5 prompt_tokens=6889 completion_tokens=388\r\n"]
[0.003, "o", "{\r\n  \"class\": \"real_defect\",\r\n  \"confidence\": \"high\",\r\n  \"requirementId\": \"CYPRESS-RWA-TRANSACTIONS-007\",\r\n  \"rationale\": \"The API hint for POST /transactions explicitly documents: 'the persisted/returned transaction.amount equals the submitted dollar amount multiplied by 100 (stored in cents) — assert this exactly.' The test submits amount: 50 (dollars) and correctly asserts transaction.amount should be 5000 (cents). However, all three runs consistently return transaction.amount: 50 instead of 5000, indicating the application is not converting dollars to cents as documented. This is a real defect in the application's transaction creation logic.\",\r\n  \"repro\": [\r\n    \"Authenticate as a seeded user (e.g., uBmeaz5pX)\",\r\n    \"GET /bankAccounts to obtain a bank account ID (e.g., pgl34JtnfhX)\",\r\n    \"GET /testData/users to obtain a receiver ID (e.g., GjWovtg2hr)\",\r\n    \"POST /transactions with body: {\\\"transactionType\\\": \\\"payment\\\", \\\"source\\\": \\\"pgl34JtnfhX\\\", \\\"receiverId\\\": \\\"GjWovtg2hr\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\""]
[0.000, "o", "Payment for services\\\", \\\"amount\\\": 50, \\\"privacyLevel\\\": \\\"public\\\"}\",\r\n    \"Observe: response.body.transaction.amount returns 50\",\r\n    \"Expected: response.body.transaction.amount should return 5000 (50 dollars * 100 cents/dollar)\"\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n-> correctly identified as a real application defect.\r\n\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "========================================================================\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "STEP 7 — revert the defect, confirm the app — not the test — was the variable\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "========================================================================\r\n"]
[3.452, "o", "CYPRESS-RWA-TRANSACTIONS-007-positive-001: runs=[pass, pass, pass] -> PASS\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "========================================================================\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "STEP done — summary\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "========================================================================\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "Requirement CYPRESS-RWA-TRANSACTIONS-007 -> generated test CYPRESS-RWA-TRANSACTIONS-007-positive-001 -> PASS on clean app -> FAIL under\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "seeded defect \"payment-amount-cents\" -> triaged correctly -> PASS again after revert.\r\n"]
